  "result": "I made three edits to fix the seat counts, but I haven't run the test suite, so none of it is verified.\n\n- **Periodic recount:** `recomputeUsage` in `usage-repository.ts` now counts only members whose status is `active` and who haven't been archived. Before, it counted every member row, including removed ones.\n- **Removing a member:** `usage-service.ts` now has a `member.removed` listener that lowers `seatsUsed` by 1 straight away. This mirrors the existing `member.joined` listener.\n- **Revoked invitations:** `countPendingInvitations` in `invitation-repository.ts` now skips revoked invitations as well as accepted ones. So revoking an invitation frees its seat. Re-sending also works in a full workspace, because the old invitation is revoked before the new one is checked against the limit. A workspace that really is full is still refused.",
